  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The revised objective is to improve agricultural production and access to markets for Georgia&apos;s small and medium-scale farmers and rural enterprises supported by the project, through: (i) increasing the competitiveness of selected supply chains; (ii) strengthening the delivery of rural financial services and of the financial intermediaries; and (iii) modernizing key institutions for food safety and property registration with direct impact for increasing competitiveness of Georgia&apos;s agriculture.</narrative>
  </description>
